et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UgrOEFM27CoQ7kNvwFhCW4b&_nc_oc=AdlVpfxXfhYhpLZxvSTBXV5PDn_IoNCZXNnktjqdpMVKFhngpqz4_bx_ANt6fqKbvCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsWmQY8a1GHSOH6tsy-jnS5sRe0m5CM7T4JtR0BDFiiPQ&oe=699DAA1F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pAIFe9QY6KQQ7kNvwF6Ol75&_nc_oc=AdmiT36z2lcEdwFXCHEWezBxjxmsb6i9A8wHc92m77YdLrUPl9qOZ1guso2hXMLXAk0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0IIkYhAQeqglIpSi7XCVjMCGvTn_it8laAra0NusisQ&oe=699DA607"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LynItwa1-qgQ7kNvwGhehUO&_nc_oc=AdmPxsdNAvg1DnHNfZweEG0bd1wiXYx2GEz239ZbIogC4Ao9MMCQ_jtoOpyA4cVTWmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftgVoPlY4lG21AprTTTSmwS-3pYDoAQdDq_JB9lveEwWQ&oe=699DAA57"}, {"file_name": "